Load the shortcuts service bridge.

The composery-shortcuts builtin needs workbench services with no public
extension API equivalent. The bridge that exposes them is a whole file of ours
(overlay, contrib/terminal/browser/shortcuts.contribution.ts), so all upstream
owes it is this side-effect import - which is the entire patch.

